# The build context of Dockerfile.capacity-planner (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in place of .dockerignore). Only what it copies:
# the module, the command and internal/, test files and testdata left out.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/capacity-planner/
!internal/
cmd/capacity-planner/**/*_test.go
cmd/capacity-planner/testdata/
internal/**/*_test.go
internal/**/testdata/
